# Normalise line endings. The shell scripts here are the gate's entry point in CI
# and on developer machines; checked out with CRLF they do not run at all — bash
# reads `set -euo pipefail\r` and reports `pipefail: invalid option name`. That is
# a one-character failure that looks like a broken tool rather than a broken
# checkout, so it is fixed here rather than explained in the README.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
